1
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:11,609
I hear your fist upon the wood,

2
00:00:11,759 --> 00:00:15,449
The steam is choking round the sink.

3
00:00:15,539 --> 00:00:18,789
You never care what children could,

4
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:22,960
Just what the family will think!

5
00:00:24,239 --> 00:00:27,850
You count the marks, you count the pride,

6
00:00:27,929 --> 00:00:31,850
And choke him in your bitter cage!

7
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:35,570
To keep your own small soul inside,

8
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:40,799
You feed him nineteen years of rage!

9
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:50,049
I stood upon the stair at night,

10
00:00:50,429 --> 00:00:54,079
While you were snoring in the dark.

11
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,450
He played without a candle light,

12
00:00:58,049 --> 00:01:01,340
The red accordion, a spark!

13
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:05,019
That was his soul upon the reed,

14
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:08,620
A beauty bleeding through the floor!

15
00:01:08,799 --> 00:01:12,319
A beating heart you cannot breed,

16
00:01:12,349 --> 00:01:16,799
With numbers locked behind the door!

17
00:01:18,299 --> 00:01:21,719
The wet cloth slams against the tile,

18
00:01:21,750 --> 00:01:25,799
My back is straight, my silence ends!

19
00:01:25,909 --> 00:01:29,519
Wipe off that cruel and ugly smile,

20
00:01:29,700 --> 00:01:33,319
Tonight your petty kingdom bends!

21
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:37,120
Take his keys and you take my life,

22
00:01:37,299 --> 00:01:40,730
Break his wings and you break us all!

23
00:01:40,790 --> 00:01:44,469
No longer your obedient wife,

24
00:01:44,519 --> 00:02:04,230
I'll pack his bags and watch you fall!

25
00:02:04,700 --> 00:02:11,530
Step back, Albert, leave him free,

26
00:02:12,259 --> 00:02:18,699
You'll eat your cabbage alone at tea!